Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt, speed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurricane, locate the shortest path!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow, bring out the shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,these trains are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Each train has been specifically designed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to ensure that you’ll all like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t worry! I’ve got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to drive Lightning Angel anymore, Mr. Slowy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to drive Morning Sun anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning Sun does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t suit me one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning Sun does much more than "nothing".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s an incredible mechanics train.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Try out the repair button.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to be a mechanic, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be on the frontlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to handle logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not built for attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I intentionally set this up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, you need to learn how to watch after your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, you also need to learn how to protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The trains can turn into a house, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll rest for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,give the Energy Seed to Weslie for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember that I put the Energy Seed inside a safe box?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My high-tech safe box is completely break-proof
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and environmentally friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can only be opened with all six of our handprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy taking it isn’t even a big deal, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Incorrect!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because we have the safe box
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn’t mean it’s safe to leave the Energy Seed unattended.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,use Hurricane to locate the Energy Seed is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Hurricane’s search,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the Energy Seed is most likely to be at one of these places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go split up and search.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll stay here and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t we swap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Angel is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This swap was a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Finders keepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright, Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to see what Lightning Angel is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re so done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix up the train for me, Tibbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we have the Energy Seed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get my strength and youth back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can catch all the goats I want, whenever I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of stupid box is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mr. Slowy’s specially invented safe box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to collect all six of the goats’ handprints
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to get to the Energy Seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're brilliant, Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning: We have been surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay. We've still got Paddi and Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.06,0:08:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just Jonie now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Jonie go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Jonie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All that’s left now is that old goat’s handprint,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Energy Seed will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn’t wreaked havoc on the grass with Lightning Angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys wouldn’t have run into so many obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it’s my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have messed around with Morning Sun so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, you old goat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t hurt Mr. Slowy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yell all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, stupid weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for being "powerful", huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to watch them get braised, steamed, and fried,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,go clear the road and fix my train.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t hurt them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to learn to protect everyone with courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I also have to learn to watch over everyone with patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,is Tibbie really going to be okay with clearing the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s just a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate Tibbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Angel is her signature train.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Slowy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I rescued all of my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,while I was repairing Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He took back the Energy Seed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.02,0:11:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic assembly, unmatchable energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mr. Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve arrived at the Big Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a branch up ahead blocking our road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clear it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do some maintenance on your Lightning Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they understand my aim now.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
